# Function boundaries of tailcall_ttt2.s as a control-flow walk of the program gives them (each
# function's reachable code, capped at the next entry point), one "start end" label pair per line.
# scripts/codegen-smoke-test.sh turns this into the [functions] reference recomp/tools/resolve_functions.py
# checks the codegen errors against: the test's stand-in for TTT2 Web's published table. _start has a
# .pdata entry and needs no line.
gapfill_leaf fwd_merge
fwd_merge leaf_tail
leaf_tail merged_tail
merged_tail adjustor_thunk
adjustor_thunk tail_to_gapfill
tail_to_gapfill ptr_func
ptr_func ptr_end
ptr_leaf ptr_leaf_end
